        "content_text": "Fire is both friend and foe for Australia's wildflowers.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/science/2026-08-12/australian-flowers-love-hate-relationship-with-fire-heating-up/106732114\">Many of Australia's floral species have evolved over millions of years alongside fire, but are bushfires [forest fires] becoming too frequent for some flowers to survive?</a>",
