        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/claude.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CarPlay has picked up its fifth major AI chatbot app with the addition of Claude. Anthropic’s iPhone app adding CarPlay is the second AI chatbot app to be updated with support this week.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,anthropic,apps,carplay,claude\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067510\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/carplay-now-works-with-five-major-chatbot-apps/#more-1067510\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
