        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/03/apples-big-roadmap-for-new-mac-and-ipad-models-revealed-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/03/macbook-air-m4-m3.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new report <a href=\"https://omdiaevents.com/china-display-conference/comparison-and-analysis-of-oled-processes/\">from <em>Omdia</em></a> offers fresh details on Apple’s roadmap for new MacBook Pro, MacBook Air, and iPad models in the years ahead. Here’s what it says is coming.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,ipad,mac\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067244\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/03/apples-big-roadmap-for-new-mac-and-ipad-models-revealed-report/#more-1067244\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
