        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/sonos-unveils-sonos-27-software-with-four-new-features/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/sonos-white-product-speaker.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today alongside launching <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/sonos-launches-new-ultra-headphones-and-soundbar-plus-more/\">two new products</a>, Sonos has unveiled ‘Sonos 27’ branding for its software platform and detailed four new features coming soon for Sonos users.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"sonos\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066960\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/sonos-unveils-sonos-27-software-with-four-new-features/#more-1066960\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
