        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/sonos-launches-new-ultra-headphones-and-soundbar-plus-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/sonos-ace-ultra-headphones.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sonos has announced two new hardware products today—Ace headphones and a Beam soundbar with ‘Ultra’ branding—alongside rebranding its software as ‘Sonos 27.’ Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"sonos\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066944\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/sonos-launches-new-ultra-headphones-and-soundbar-plus-more/#more-1066944\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
