        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/iphone-ultra-release-timing-heres-what-the-latest-reporting-says/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/iphone-ultra-concept-blue.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple will unveil its foldable iPhone Ultra next week at <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/27/how-to-watch-apples-september-event-iphone-18-pro-iphone-ultra-more/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1066399\">the September event</a>, but it’s unclear exactly when the new model will ship to users. Here’s what to expect per the latest reporting.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-ultra\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066832\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/iphone-ultra-release-timing-heres-what-the-latest-reporting-says/#more-1066832\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
