        "title": "Fender MIX headphones now have an iPhone app for tuning your sound",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/fender-mix-headphones-now-have-an-iphone-app-for-tuning-your-sound/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/Fender-MIX-app.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In August, Fender released the $299 MIX wireless headphones. The over-ear headphones come with a replaceable battery and the FWD Tx USB-C wireless transmitter for low-latency, lossless connectivity. Fender MIX headphones also now include an iPhone app for tuning the experience.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067455\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/fender-mix-headphones-now-have-an-iphone-app-for-tuning-your-sound/#more-1067455\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
