        "url": "https://9to5google.com/2026/09/03/lenovo-ideapad-vibe-is-a-macbook-neo-competitor-starting-at-699/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/lenovo-ideapad-vibe-1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lenovo is taking on the MacBook Neo with a colorful new laptop – the IdeaPad Vibe.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067289\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/09/03/lenovo-ideapad-vibe-is-a-macbook-neo-competitor-starting-at-699/#more-1067289\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
