        "title": "Apple Wallet driver’s license support launches in Oklahoma",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/02/apple-wallet-drivers-license-support-launches-in-oklahoma/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/ok.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is rolling out support for Apple Wallet driver’s license integration to a new state. Starting today, Oklahoma residents can add their license to the Wallet app on iPhone and Apple Watch for easy mobile access.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-wallet\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067091\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/02/apple-wallet-drivers-license-support-launches-in-oklahoma/#more-1067091\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
