        "title": "MagSafe Monday: Anker’s foldable 3-in-1 charger brings 25-watt Qi2 charging into something pocket-sized",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/ankers-foldable-3-in-1-charger-brings-25w-qi2-charging-into-something-pocket-sized/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/bradley_60288f.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The dream for your Apple gear while traveling is one thing, not a collection of cables and wall adapters. There are plenty of options for that, but often they are bulky. Anker’s Prime Qi2 25W Foldable 3-in-1 Wireless Charger aims to address that. It folds flat, weighs about as much as an iPhone 17 Pro Max, and charges your iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"magsafe-monday\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1064789\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/ankers-foldable-3-in-1-charger-brings-25w-qi2-charging-into-something-pocket-sized/#more-1064789\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
