        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/reel/860819732985841\">Let's Talk About Chopping Wood. (FB reel)</a> Nicole Coenen tells us a bit about wood.  Also how to be <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1533070871504234\">Safe</a> while chopping. Wood Chopping <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1335705957867428\">101</a>. Of course she is Canadian.  Okie-dokie.  She started her channel as a spoof of <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bradley.thor\">Thoren Bradley</a>, the OG TikTok chopper.  She has a book, too.<br/><br/>Outside Podcast:  <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/podcast/wood-chopping-nicole-coenen/\">The Unexpected Benefits of Chopping Wood</a>\nWhat does she do with her wood chopping skills? <a href=\"https://greenangels.com/stories/greenangels-wood-choppers/\">This</a>.",
