        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/spacexai-expands-grok-bot-to-ipad-as-access-expands-to-cheaper-plans/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/grokbot.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last month, SpaceXAI launched Grok Bot, an iMessage-style AI system that displays agents as teammates. The product originally arrived as an iPhone and Mac app with a very expensive price tag. In the weeks since launch, Grok Bot has expanded to the iPad and dramatically lowered the cost.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,grok-bot,ipad,spacexai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067439\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/spacexai-expands-grok-bot-to-ipad-as-access-expands-to-cheaper-plans/#more-1067439\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
