        "title": "Apple fixes frustrating TestFlight app regression that search feature update added",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/apple-fixes-frustrating-testflight-app-regression-that-search-feature-update-added/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/testflight-app.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Back in July, Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/apple-just-improved-testflight-for-users-with-a-lot-of-beta-apps/\">updated</a> its TestFlight app with a basic search feature. While you might think this simple update would be universally welcomed, the same TestFlight app introduced a pretty frustrating bug for a lot of users.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,testflight\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067372\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/04/apple-fixes-frustrating-testflight-app-regression-that-search-feature-update-added/#more-1067372\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
